        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we employed 5,845 people worldwide, made up of 2,414 in technology and development, 2,237 in care and services (who represent the portion of our GoDaddy Guides that are employed directly by GoDaddy), 369 in marketing and advertising and 825 in general and administrative functions.",
