        "accession_number": "0001609711-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to the 2,237 GoDaddy Guides discussed above, we partner with various third-party providers and vendors to provide contracted care and support services to our customers;",
        "start_character": 52868,
        "end_character": 53048
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001609711-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001609711-26-000010-0939b52146140c4c",
        "accession_number": "0001609711-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, ccTLDs are important to our international business and customers as we find that international customers often prefer a ccTLD for the country or geographic market in which they operate.",
