        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are accredited by ICANN as a domain name registrar and registry and thus our ability to offer domain name registration products is subject to our ongoing relationship with, and accreditation by, ICANN.",
